			"notes": "# Summary\n\nFirst major update; focus is on updating Red Nether Brick blocks and recipes to be at parity with Nether Brick.\n\n# Additions\n\n- Red Nether Brick item, with texture based on existing Nether Brick item and Red Nether Brick blocks\n- Red Nether Brick Fence, Red Nether Brick Fence Gate\n- Stonecutter recipes for all Concrete and Terracotta block variants\n\n# Updates / Changes\n\n- Old Red Nether Bricks recipe now yields 4 Red Nether Brick items\n- Red Nether Bricks recipe is now at parity with Nether Bricks recipe\n- Changed Nether Brick Fence Gate recipe to double its yield, matching the vanilla Nether Brick Fence recipe\n\n# Fixes\n\n- Added missing Wood and Stripped Wood Slab blocks and recipes\n- Fixed all crafting table recipes for all added stairs"
		},
