			"notes": "# 1.0.0\n\n## Summary\n\nInitial release for Minecraft 1.21.5. For a full list of added block variants, please check the README.md.\n\n## Known Issues\n\nBrick/Nether Brick Fence Gates use the wrong sounds for block break, block hit, and open / close. There are no vanilla sounds for open / close, and the block hit / break sounds appear to be pulled from a hard coded Wood Type parameter required by the vanilla code base."
